      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S A MONTY (1) finished fourth on debut then ran a much improved race last start to claim his maiden win by 5 lengths (20.54) at this track. Speedy beginner who should be in the action early off the inside. Can measure up again. FINE VIEW (2) has a strong overall record having four wins and eight places from 18 starts but was out of the money last time when eighth (20.26) over 342m at this track. Form here at this distance is sound. Has a good overall strike-rate and can find the frame here. SHE'S GOT DESIGN (7) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest when checked in the run and finishing second in a TG1-4W at this track (20.54). Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break from out wide. Worth following up. BUBBLE COASTER (8) is in the mix after placing last time out.",
